<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR INTEREST RATES SHADE LOWER AT FIX.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR INTEREST RATES SHADE LOWER AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>All Helibor rates fell slightly</p>
<p>at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Monday. The</p>
<p>three-month rate fell from 3.09 percent to 3.08 percent.</p>
<p>					May 12 fix	   May 9 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor			3.01 pct	    3.03 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor			3.05 pct	    3.06 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor			3.08 pct	    3.09 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor			3.19 pct	    3.20 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor			3.29 pct	    3.30 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		     3.40 pct	    3.41 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
